'''Sitrus Berry''' (Japanese: '''オボンのみ''' ''Obon Fruit'') is a {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Tool
|rule=Pocket Tool
|effect=At the end of each turn, if the Pokémon this card is attached to has half of its maximum HP or less remaining, heal 30 damage from it. If you do, discard this card.
}}

==Trivia==
This card's effect is almost identical to that of the {{TCG|Sitrus Berry}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].
===Origin===
*[[Sitrus Berry]] is a type of [[Berry]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that can be consumed by a Pokémon to heal its HP.

